@startuml
title UML classes — Estimate the Learning Bond
class LearningBondEstimateHandler { +GetAsync(GuardianRequest, childId): GuardianResult }
class LearningBondRule <<platform, versioned>> { Version EffectiveFrom FirstYearAmount LaterYearAmount Cap EarliestBirthYear LastEligibleAge ClaimUntilAge
+Estimate(birthYear, currentYear): EstimateResult }
class EstimateResult <<record>> { Applies Amount EligibleYears }
class LearningBondClaim { Id OrganizationId ChildId Status PausedReason EstimateAmount RuleVersion EstimatedAt }
class LearningBondIntake { HouseholdId TaxFiled TaxYear }
class LearningBondEstimateDto <<record>> { FirstName Applies Amount RuleVersion Explanation Paused }
enum PausedReason { None
NeedsSin
NeedsTaxReturn
AwaitingRecordFix }
LearningBondEstimateHandler --> LearningBondRule
LearningBondRule ..> EstimateResult
LearningBondEstimateHandler ..> LearningBondClaim
LearningBondEstimateHandler ..> LearningBondIntake
LearningBondEstimateHandler ..> LearningBondEstimateDto
LearningBondClaim --> PausedReason
@enduml
